#
# Build context of every image built with the CHECKOUT ROOT as its context —
# today only the RL reranker (claude_mcp_servers/rl_reranker/Dockerfile; the
# launcher's `container_build` install and the `rl_reranker` compose service
# both build it from here). It needs the root because it imports files that
# live outside its own directory and must not be duplicated into it:
# claude_mcp_servers/rl_client/rl_logger.py and the stdlib-only
# vco_lib/{rl_training_targets,atomic,log_setup,rl_weights_ownership}.py (+ the
# rl_weights_ownership.toml table that last one reads).
#
# Whitelist, so a root-context build never ships the rest of the checkout
# (launcher sources, node_modules, cargo targets, .venv, state). Keep it in
# step with the Dockerfile's COPY set: tests/rl_reranker/test_image_sources.py
# fails when a file the reranker imports is not both COPYed and listed here.
# (podman and docker both read `.dockerignore` at the context root.)
*
!claude_mcp_servers/rl_reranker/
claude_mcp_servers/rl_reranker/**/__pycache__
claude_mcp_servers/rl_reranker/scripts/
claude_mcp_servers/rl_reranker/training/
!claude_mcp_servers/rl_client/rl_logger.py
!vco_lib/rl_training_targets.py
!vco_lib/atomic.py
!vco_lib/log_setup.py
!vco_lib/rl_weights_ownership.py
!vco_lib/rl_weights_ownership.toml
